  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-04T07:41:44.343Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If forced near clipping can't be saved per session or in general because it \"breaks certain worlds\" (I've only encountered like 3 so far out of the thousands I've visited), then at least it could be saved for the world in which it is toggled. If I decide, that in some certain world the stock camera clipping settings aren't good enough and I want to change them, then I probably want to do that the next time again. So just save us the hassle and save it. In any way..",
